  <p id="c-sanguozhi-028-wangling:unit008" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note"><title id="c-sanguozhi-028-wangling:unit008:w0000" ref="w-weilue-sgz028-reference">魏畧</title>曰<persName id="c-sanguozhi-028-wangling:unit008:m0003" ref="f89_ad1_61d">凌</persName>聞東平民<persName id="c-sanguozhi-028-wangling:unit008:m0008" ref="7ea_1ab_81a">浩詳</persName>知星呼問<persName id="c-sanguozhi-028-wangling:unit008:m0014" ref="7ea_1ab_81a">詳</persName><persName id="c-sanguozhi-028-wangling:unit008:m0015" ref="7ea_1ab_81a">詳</persName>疑<persName id="c-sanguozhi-028-wangling:unit008:m0017" ref="f89_ad1_61d">凌</persName>有所挾欲恱<persName id="c-sanguozhi-028-wangling:unit008:m0023" ref="f89_ad1_61d">其</persName>意不言吳當有死喪而言淮南楚分也今吳楚同占當有<rs id="c-sanguozhi-028-wangling:unit008:m0046" type="unresolved">王者</rs>興故<persName id="c-sanguozhi-028-wangling:unit008:m0050" ref="f89_ad1_61d">凌</persName>計遂定</p>
